    "detailed_description": "<strong>Enter Octopus City</strong>, the last bastion of humanity in a frozen world.<br><br>Meet the cowardly <strong>Kaf Kafkaryan</strong>, a tentacle trimmer living on a giant octopus.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/5cabc39df913a252f60a2b5ed17fa719.poster.avif?t=1753735149\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/5cabc39df913a252f60a2b5ed17fa719.gif?t=1753735149\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Explore bizarre worlds and unravel <strong>dark conspiracies</strong> as the line between dream and reality begins to blur.<br><br>Talk to <strong>eccentric</strong> people with their own motives and schedules. Learn their secrets and spread scandalous <strong>rumors</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/6b3a6c8baf088dbfc5d3a86334d5e508.poster.avif?t=1753735149\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/6b3a6c8baf088dbfc5d3a86334d5e508.webm?t=1753735149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/6b3a6c8baf088dbfc5d3a86334d5e508.mp4?t=1753735149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Handle <strong>tense situations</strong> while keeping your anxiety in check. Make <strong>difficult decisions</strong> with long-lasting consequences.<br><br><strong>Ghost in a Bottle</strong> presents <strong>Octopus City Blues</strong>: the world's first Octopus City Simulation. Please support us by adding it to your wishlist!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Enter Octopus City</strong>, the last bastion of humanity in a frozen world.<br><br>Meet the cowardly <strong>Kaf Kafkaryan</strong>, a tentacle trimmer living on a giant octopus.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/5cabc39df913a252f60a2b5ed17fa719.poster.avif?t=1753735149\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/5cabc39df913a252f60a2b5ed17fa719.gif?t=1753735149\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>Explore bizarre worlds and unravel <strong>dark conspiracies</strong> as the line between dream and reality begins to blur.<br><br>Talk to <strong>eccentric</strong> people with their own motives and schedules. Learn their secrets and spread scandalous <strong>rumors</strong>.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/6b3a6c8baf088dbfc5d3a86334d5e508.poster.avif?t=1753735149\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/6b3a6c8baf088dbfc5d3a86334d5e508.webm?t=1753735149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1192230/extras/6b3a6c8baf088dbfc5d3a86334d5e508.mp4?t=1753735149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Handle <strong>tense situations</strong> while keeping your anxiety in check. Make <strong>difficult decisions</strong> with long-lasting consequences.<br><br><strong>Ghost in a Bottle</strong> presents <strong>Octopus City Blues</strong>: the world's first Octopus City Simulation. Please support us by adding it to your wishlist!",
